{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53379","headline":"委羽山 · 顾况","name":"委羽山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔人乘鹤玉京游，翮遗仙洞何悠悠。\n我来寻觅空彝犹，烟霞万壑明清秋。\n何当骑麟翳凤登瀛洲，倏忽能消万古愁。\n（见《古今图书集成·山川典》卷一二○《委羽山部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}